---
layout: base.njk
title: "Changelog & Version Support Matrix"
description: "Current versions, release dates, and support status for CDC tools and platforms covered in this guide."
canonicalPath: "/versions/"
---
{% import "components/ui.njk" as ui %}

<div class="page-wrap prose">
  <header class="page-header">
    <h1>Changelog &amp; Version Support Matrix</h1>
    <p class="text-xl">
      This page tracks the current versions of CDC tools and platforms covered in our guides.
      Last updated: <strong>{{ toolVersions.lastUpdated }}</strong>
    </p>
  </header>

  <section id="version-matrix" aria-labelledby="version-matrix-title">
    <h2 id="version-matrix-title">Supported Tool Versions</h2>
    <p>
      All guides and labs are tested against these versions. While CDC concepts remain consistent,
      specific configuration syntax and features may vary between versions.
    </p>

    <table class="version-table">
      <caption class="sr-only">CDC tool versions and release information</caption>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">Tool/Platform</th>
          <th scope="col">Version</th>
          <th scope="col">Release Date</th>
          <th scope="col">Status</th>
          <th scope="col">Release Notes</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Debezium</th>
          <td><code>{{ toolVersions.tools.debezium.version }}</code></td>
          <td>{{ toolVersions.tools.debezium.releaseDate }}</td>
          <td><span class="status-badge status-{{ toolVersions.tools.debezium.status }}">{{ toolVersions.tools.debezium.status }}</span></td>
          <td><a href="{{ toolVersions.tools.debezium.releaseNotesUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Release Notes</a></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Apache Kafka</th>
          <td><code>{{ toolVersions.tools.kafka.version }}</code></td>
          <td>{{ toolVersions.tools.kafka.releaseDate }}</td>
          <td><span class="status-badge status-{{ toolVersions.tools.kafka.status }}">{{ toolVersions.tools.kafka.status }}</span></td>
          <td><a href="{{ toolVersions.tools.kafka.releaseNotesUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Downloads</a></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Kafka Connect</th>
          <td><code>{{ toolVersions.tools.kafkaConnect.version }}</code></td>
          <td>{{ toolVersions.tools.kafkaConnect.releaseDate }}</td>
          <td><span class="status-badge status-{{ toolVersions.tools.kafkaConnect.status }}">{{ toolVersions.tools.kafkaConnect.status }}</span></td>
          <td><a href="{{ toolVersions.tools.kafkaConnect.releaseNotesUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Documentation</a></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">PostgreSQL</th>
          <td><code>{{ toolVersions.tools.postgres.version }}</code></td>
          <td>{{ toolVersions.tools.postgres.releaseDate }}</td>
          <td><span class="status-badge status-{{ toolVersions.tools.postgres.status }}">{{ toolVersions.tools.postgres.status }}</span></td>
          <td><a href="{{ toolVersions.tools.postgres.releaseNotesUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Release Notes</a></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Matillion</th>
          <td><code>{{ toolVersions.tools.matillion.version }}</code></td>
          <td>{{ toolVersions.tools.matillion.releaseDate }}</td>
          <td><span class="status-badge status-{{ toolVersions.tools.matillion.status }}">{{ toolVersions.tools.matillion.status }}</span></td>
          <td><a href="{{ toolVersions.tools.matillion.releaseNotesUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Release Notes</a></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">AWS DMS</th>
          <td><code>{{ toolVersions.tools.awsDms.version }}</code></td>
          <td>{{ toolVersions.tools.awsDms.releaseDate }}</td>
          <td><span class="status-badge status-{{ toolVersions.tools.awsDms.status }}">{{ toolVersions.tools.awsDms.status }}</span></td>
          <td><a href="{{ toolVersions.tools.awsDms.releaseNotesUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Release Notes</a></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Fivetran</th>
          <td><code>{{ toolVersions.tools.fivetran.version }}</code></td>
          <td>{{ toolVersions.tools.fivetran.releaseDate }}</td>
          <td><span class="status-badge status-{{ toolVersions.tools.fivetran.status }}">{{ toolVersions.tools.fivetran.status }}</span></td>
          <td><a href="{{ toolVersions.tools.fivetran.releaseNotesUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Changelog</a></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Oracle GoldenGate</th>
          <td><code>{{ toolVersions.tools.goldenGate.version }}</code></td>
          <td>{{ toolVersions.tools.goldenGate.releaseDate }}</td>
          <td><span class="status-badge status-{{ toolVersions.tools.goldenGate.status }}">{{ toolVersions.tools.goldenGate.status }}</span></td>
          <td><a href="{{ toolVersions.tools.goldenGate.releaseNotesUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Release Notes</a></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

  <section id="support-policy" aria-labelledby="support-policy-title">
    <h2 id="support-policy-title">Support Policy</h2>
    <dl class="status-legend">
      <dt><span class="status-badge status-stable">stable</span></dt>
      <dd>
        Production-ready release with stable APIs and comprehensive documentation.
        Our guides are actively maintained for these versions.
      </dd>
      
      <dt><span class="status-badge status-saas">saas</span></dt>
      <dd>
        Software-as-a-Service platforms that auto-update. Guides reflect current production behavior
        as of the last update date.
      </dd>
      
      <dt><span class="status-badge status-deprecated">deprecated</span></dt>
      <dd>
        Older versions that still work but should be upgraded. Guides may reference newer patterns.
      </dd>
    </dl>
  </section>

  <section id="compatibility" aria-labelledby="compatibility-title">
    <h2 id="compatibility-title">Compatibility Notes</h2>
    
    <h3>Debezium + Kafka</h3>
    <p>
      Debezium {{ toolVersions.tools.debezium.version }} is tested with Kafka {{ toolVersions.tools.kafka.version }}.
      For other combinations, consult the 
      <a href="https://debezium.io/documentation/reference/stable/operations/debezium-server.html#_supported_versions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        Debezium version compatibility matrix
      </a>.
    </p>

    <h3>Kafka Connect</h3>
    <p>
      Kafka Connect is bundled with Apache Kafka. The version numbers align, so Kafka {{ toolVersions.tools.kafka.version }}
      includes Kafka Connect {{ toolVersions.tools.kafkaConnect.version }}.
    </p>

    <h3>PostgreSQL (Source Database)</h3>
    <p>
      Hands-on labs use PostgreSQL {{ toolVersions.tools.postgres.version }} via the Debezium-tuned container image.
      Logical replication is enabled out of the box so you can register the connector without extra Postgres configuration.
    </p>

    <h3>Cloud Platforms</h3>
    <p>
      AWS DMS, Fivetran, and SaaS CDC platforms use their own versioning schemes and handle updates automatically.
      Our cloud labs reflect current production behavior as of {{ toolVersions.lastUpdated }}.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="update-frequency" aria-labelledby="update-frequency-title">
    <h2 id="update-frequency-title">Update Frequency</h2>
    <p>
      This version matrix is reviewed and updated quarterly by our automated site-content-review agent.
      If you notice a version is outdated, please 
      <a href="{{ '/errata/' | url }}">report an issue</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Next scheduled review:</strong> Check back after the start of each quarter (January, April, July, October).
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="changelog" aria-labelledby="changelog-title">
    <h2 id="changelog-title">Site Changelog</h2>
    <p>
      For the complete history of site updates, content additions, and feature improvements,
      see the <a href="https://github.com/{{ site.repository }}/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        CHANGELOG.md on GitHub
      </a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="related-resources" aria-labelledby="related-resources-title">
    <h2 id="related-resources-title">Related Resources</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <a href="{{ '/observability/' | url }}">Observability Basics</a>
        — Monitor version-specific metrics and behavior
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="{{ '/cloud-labs/' | url }}">Cloud CDC Labs</a>
        — Platform-specific implementation guides
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="{{ '/quickstarts/' | url }}">Database Quickstarts</a>
        — Database-specific connector setup
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="{{ '/tooling/' | url }}">Ecosystem Overview</a>
        — Complete CDC tool landscape
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</div>
